<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Reason&nbsp;Draft&nbsp;(6)</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p><em>I guess I'm just as bad. I don't want to hurt anyone, even if it'd be only for better.</em></p>
<p><em>Being a scumbag is just so easy.</em></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Rejection&nbsp;Reasoning&nbsp;Draft&nbsp;(7)</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Reason&nbsp;Draft&nbsp;(7)</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p><em>I talked to her. She said she just doesn't want to talk to you, and that it's not that complicated. She's right too. It's not complicated, but I do know it's hard. So, if you need a shoulder to cry on, I'm still here.</em></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Rejection&nbsp;Reasoning&nbsp;Draft&nbsp;(Final)</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Reason&nbsp;Draft&nbsp;(Final)</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p><strong>Removing all annotations and suggestions</strong></p>
<p><em>Do not use Foundation resources to deal with non-anomalous, personal matters.</em></p>
<p><em>If you have any concerns, please talk to me.</em></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br />
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p>Review completed by Dr. Rachel Frie</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="footnotes-footer">
<div class="title">Footnotes</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-1"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-1')">1</a>. <span style="color: blue">You breached this when you asked me for help.</span></div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-2"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-2')">2</a>. <span style="color: blue">Anyone else? There really wasn't anyone else?</span></div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-3"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-3')">3</a>. <span style="color: blue">You don't need to say how much you enjoyed it&#8230;</span></div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-4"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-4')">4</a>. <span style="color: blue">You told me you were jealous. That she got to move on to bigger things and left you behind. Are you lying to yourself about that as well?</span></div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-5"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-5')">5</a>. <span style="color: blue">Does this not sound clingy to you? Is this how you justify just being a self absorbed little shit?</span></div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-6"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-6')">6</a>. <span style="color: blue">Her volume was fine.</span></div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-7"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-7')">7</a>. <span style="color: blue">You didn't even give me time to talk. I had a conversation with her about you anyways. Before you decided to write this. I've been sitting on it for a while&#8230;</span></div>
